{
  "text": " I was one of the first people to have the COVID-19 vaccine. I helped out in the vaccine center. I was in Good Morning Britain helping tackle vaccine hesitancy. I did not conceive of the possibility that a vaccine could cause any real harm at all. It wasn't even part of it. It wasn't even anywhere in my brain. What we're dealing with now with hindsight is perhaps the greatest miscarriage of medical science we will witness in our lifetime. What in the world is going on? What's changed? And this is worldwide. It's worldwide. What's changed in the world all at the same time, all working to suppress the free interchange of information around SARS-CoV-2, COVID-19, and the vaccines? Two of the world's biggest voices in heart health are now standing together discussing COVID and the vaccine. On November 29th, the Vaccine Safety Research Foundation presents Deep in the Heart of Texas with Dr. Peter McCullough and Dr. Essi Malhotra, speaking live in Dallas, along with a performance by Five Times August. I'm gonna stand here and I'll fight for every word I'm gonna shout the truth until you know it's heard. Get your tickets now at vaccine-safety.org slash events.",
